{"name":"v04_CD1_27 - Paranoya - Shallow Silence","date":"2001-07-10T22:21:56.000Z","clearFrame":false,"components":[{"type":"Comment","group":"Misc","text":"Whoaaah, this is not just the regular ParaNoya-stuff you're seeing here. I just wanted to go a little more abstract and x-perimental with this one and hey this just looks damn nice too me. This is a VERY dynamic preset. Mainly achieved that with using alpha blending. I didn't see much preset artist play with this so I gave it a try. It creates some really cool blending inside the preset, making the movement bobble up in one part of your screen while letting it fade away in some other part. Combined with my really dynamic movements it almost makes this preset look like some living creature. :)\r\nThe scopes just make some cool figures to bring the preset to even an higher level. I wanted to experiment some with getosc en getspec in scope and this is it's result.\r\n\r\nI hope you don't mind me x-perimenting some most of the time my experiments aren't liked as much as my regular style. I hope this one is a exception to that, since I put some hard work in this baby.\r\n\r\nGreetingzz\r\n\r\nParaNoya\r\n(parajunk@icqmail.com)\r\nhttp://paranoya.deviantart.com\r\n10-07-2001\r\n\r\n======================================================\r\nParaNoya:\r\nMaking you not believe your eyes, is what I do best."},{"type":"SetRenderMode","group":"Misc","blend":"ADDITIVE","adjustBlend":0,"lineSize":1,"enabled":true},{"type":"SuperScope","group":"Render","code":{"init":"n=200","perFrame":"n=if(equal(red+blue+green,0),0,200);st=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),below(bc,5)),0,1);fr=fr+0.02*st;e=cos(fr)/2+0.5","onBeat":"bc=if(st,0,bc+1)","perPoint":"x=(if(above(i,0.5),-(i*2-1),i*2-1)+0.5)*2*e-(e-1)*(i*2-1);\r\ny=v/2+if(above(i,0.5),0.5,-0.5)*e"},"audioChannel":"CENTER","audioSource":"WAVEFORM","colors":["#404080","#404080","#000000","#000000","#000000","#804040","#804040","#000000","#000000","#000000"],"drawMode":"LINES"},{"type":"SetRenderMode","group":"Misc","blend":"ADDITIVE","adjustBlend":0,"lineSize":2,"enabled":true},{"type":"MovingParticle","group":"Render","enabled":true,"onBeatSizeChange":true,"color":"#ff4040","distance":32,"particleSize":4,"onBeatParticleSize":19,"blendMode":"Additive"},{"type":"MovingParticle","group":"Render","enabled":true,"onBeatSizeChange":true,"color":"#ff8040","distance":32,"particleSize":4,"onBeatParticleSize":19,"blendMode":"Additive"},{"type":"MovingParticle","group":"Render","enabled":true,"onBeatSizeChange":true,"color":"#ff40ff","distance":32,"particleSize":4,"onBeatParticleSize":19,"blendMode":"Additive"},{"type":"FyrewurX","group":"Misc","enabled":true},{"type":"SuperScope","group":"Render","code":{"init":"n=600;pi=acos(-1);","perFrame":"beat1=if(above(beat1,0.5),beat1-0.05,beat1);t=t+0.02*k;m=m+0.05*beat1;n=if(equal(red+green+blue,0),0,800)","onBeat":"t=t+0.2;m=m-0.2;beat1=4;bc=bc+1;k=if(equal(bc%5,0),pow(-1,rand(5)),k)","perPoint":"i=i*pi*4;\r\nt=if(above(i,0.5),t-pi,t);\r\nx=((cos(i)/2+v*cos(i)/2))/4*beat1/2+sin(t)*(cos(m)/4+0.5);\r\ny=((sin(i)+(v-1)*sin(i)/2))/4*beat1/2+cos(t)*(cos(m)/4+0.5)"},"audioChannel":"CENTER","audioSource":"WAVEFORM","colors":["#4040ff","#000000","#000000","#ff8040","#000000","#000000","#ff4040","#000000","#000000","#ff40ff","#000000","#000000"],"drawMode":"DOTS"},{"type":"FyrewurX","group":"Misc","enabled":true},{"type":"SuperScope","group":"Render","code":{"init":"n=400;pi=acos(-1);bc=0;st=1;t=0.5;fr=0.5;m=0.5","perFrame":"t=t+0.05;m=m+0.05;beat2=if(below(beat2,1),beat2+0.04,beat2);st=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),below(bc,10)),0,1);fr=fr+0.02*st;e=cos(fr)/2+0.5;","onBeat":"beat2=0;bc=if(st,0,bc+1);t=t+0.2;m=m-0.2","perPoint":"i=e*(i*pi-atan(t%m)*sin(m+i)-cos(i))-(e-1)*(i*pi+getspec(t,v,cos(i+t))*atan(i)-cos(i+v)*cos(m));\r\nv=v/2;r=e*r-(e-1)*((i*pi-cos(t+sin(m)))*beat2);\r\nx=e*(if(above(i,0.5),sin(i)+getspec(sin(i),cos(t)/4+0.5,0)*2,sin(i-t)*cos(m-sin(t)+i)))-(e-1)*(cos(i-r)*sin(r)+cos(t)*sin(m-v));\r\ny=e*(if(below(i,0.6),sin(getosc(i,0,0.5))/8,cos(m+sin(v)*sin(t))))-(e-1)*(atan(i)+sin(r-v+t)-atan(m-sin(t+i))+cos(m)+1);\r\nx=e*(x*2-0.5)-(e-1)*x;"},"audioChannel":"CENTER","audioSource":"WAVEFORM","colors":["#ff5555","#ffbb55","#ddff55","#77ff55","#55ff99","#55ffff","#5599ff","#7755ff","#dd55ff","#ff55bb"],"drawMode":"LINES"},{"type":"DynamicMovement","group":"Trans","code":{"init":"beat1=1;pi=acos(-1);beat3=0.01;bc=0;bc1=0","perFrame":"t=t+0.01*beat1;\r\nm=m+0.05-beat1/100;\r\nbeat1=beat1-0.05;\r\nbeat3=if(above(beat3,0),beat3-0.05,beat3);\r\nst=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),below(bc1,10)),0,1);fr=fr+0.02*st;e=cos(fr)/2+0.5;","onBeat":"beat1=rand(8)+1;\r\nk=pow(-1,beat1);\r\nbeat3=1;\r\nbc=if(below(bc,18),bc+1,0);\r\nbc1=if(st,0,bc+1);\r\nj=rand(2);\r\n","perPoint":"alpha=if(below(bc,5),k*y*beat3-d*(beat3-1),if(below(bc,11),k*x*beat3-d*(beat3-1),k*(sin(r+cos(t)))*beat3-d*(Beat3-1)));\r\nd=e*(-d+cos(x+0.5)*cos(t)+sin(y+1)*sin(m)+atan(d+t))-(e-1)*(sin(d)*d-cos(x|(y*j+(j-1)*r-sin(t)*4)));\r\nr=e*r-(e-1)*(r+asin(getspec(x,sin(m),0)))\r\n\r\n"},"bFilter":true,"coord":"POLAR","gridW":12,"gridH":12,"blend":true,"wrap":true,"buffer":0,"alphaOnly":false},{"type":"BlitterFeedback","group":"Misc","zoom":30,"onBeatZoom":42,"blendMode":"REPLACE","onBeat":"true","bilinear":true},{"type":"Blur","group":"Trans","blur":"MEDIUM"}]}